[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
A one-shot command for cron, not a service:

  immich-auto-album -u -t file /mnt/library \
      http://localhost:2283/api %%PREFIX%%/etc/immich-auto-album.key

It walks an external library and creates one album per folder. Without
-u it asks first, which is what a run by hand wants. With -t file the
key comes from the named file instead of the command line, where the
process list would show it; create that file at mode 0600.

immich-auto-album --help lists the rest.
EOM
}
]
